games are
    "Zelda"
    "mario"
    "Mario"
    "10"
    9
    "apple"
    true
    gone
    5
    "5"
.
sort games
say games
reverse games
say games
nums are
    3
    1.5
    2
.
sort nums
say nums
name is "Jeff and Jeff"
replace "Jeff" with "Jeffrey" in name
say name
replace "." with "!" in name into shout
say name shout
tally is 3
replace 3 with 4 in tally
say tally plus 1
split "a,b,,c" by "," into parts
say length of parts parts
split "one two" by "x" into whole
say whole
join parts with " - " into joined
say joined
empty are empty
join empty with "," into nothing
say nothing "|"
find g in games where g starts with "M" into hit
say hit
find g in games where g is "nope" into miss
say miss
find n in nums where n is at least 2 into big
say big
